{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312","id":6025105866,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_Ryg","number":312,"title":"[消息队列 MQ04] 发布确认：消息发出后，怎样才算发送成功？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:40:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq04 -->\n\n**核心顺序4/9；MQ04仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n发送接口返回后，生产者凭什么判断Broker已经接收？迟迟收不到确认，又是否说明消息没进去？\n\n1. 本片自行建立生产者、目标队列、Broker和确认返回路径；固定RabbitMQ持久消息与quorum queue，逐步区分“写出请求”“Broker接收”“收到发布确认”。\n2. 从相同初始状态分两支：一支正常收到确认；另一支在Broker接收后丢失确认，生产者面对结果未知，重发可能让同一业务事件出现两份。\n3. 增加不可路由对照，说明还需观察mandatory/return等路由结果；最终回答生产者有哪些证据，哪些阶段仍不属于业务完成。\n\n观众应能解释“无确认≠确定失败”和“确认≠消费者处理完成”。本片只讲生产端证据，不深入副本协议或消费者去重实现。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n用同一eventId分别验证正常确认、接收后确认丢失、不可路由三种情况，逐项对照生产者观察与Broker实际状态。不可把连接异常画成Broker必定未接收，也不可把重发生成的新投递当成新业务事件。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\nPublisher Confirm与Consumer ACK独立；对不可路由消息也可能出现发布确认，不能只凭confirm推断进入目标队列。明确所选消息持久性、队列类型和路由配置；quorum确认有其复制条件，不推广为任意故障均不丢失。消费者业务结果不由生产端确认覆盖，RabbitMQ confirm也不直接套成Kafka acks。\n\n- [RabbitMQ Acknowledgements and Confirms](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/confirms)：发布确认、不可路由消息与消费确认。\n- [RabbitMQ Quorum Queues](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/quorum-queues)：所选队列的复制与确认条件。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；正式制作固定配置并保留故障注入证据。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/312/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}